---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---
<Legal title="Privacy Policy" updated="22 October 2026" description={`How ${SITE.company} collects, uses and protects information on ${SITE.url} and the Naqsha Zameen dashboard.`}>
  <p>
    This policy explains how {SITE.company} ("we", "us") handles information when you visit {SITE.url} (the "Website")
    or use the Naqsha Zameen dashboard at {SITE.dashboardUrl} (the "Dashboard").
  </p>

  <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Information you give us:</strong> when you contact us by WhatsApp, phone or email, we receive your name, number and anything you choose to share (for example your tehsil or chak).</li>
    <li><strong>Dashboard accounts:</strong> to provide the Dashboard we store your account details (name, user ID, mobile number, email if provided), your subscribed areas, payment records and saved map layers.</li>
    <li><strong>Usage and device data:</strong> the Dashboard records sign-in times, approximate location derived from IP address, and device information to protect accounts and enforce device limits.</li>
    <li><strong>Website visit counts:</strong> the Website counts page views using a random ID stored in your browser, the page visited, the referring site, device type and country. This is not linked to your name or account and is used only to measure how many people visit.</li>
    <li><strong>Location:</strong> the Dashboard uses your device's GPS only when you tap the locate button, to show your position on the map.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To provide, maintain and secure the Dashboard and our survey services.</li>
    <li>To reply to enquiries, prepare quotes and deliver survey results.</li>
    <li>To process subscriptions and send service notifications.</li>
    <li>To prevent fraud and account sharing.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information.</p>

  <h2>Cookies and Advertising</h2>
  <p>
    The Website may show advertisements served by third-party vendors, including Google. These vendors use cookies to
    serve ads based on your prior visits to this Website and other websites.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visits to this and/or other sites on the Internet.</li>
    <li>You may opt out of personalised advertising by visiting <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>, or opt out of some third-party vendors' use of cookies at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">aboutads.info</a>.</li>
    <li>Learn how Google uses information from sites that use its services at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener">policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites</a>.</li>
    <li>Where required by law (for example for visitors in the EEA and UK), we ask for your consent before personalised ads or non-essential cookies are used. You can change your choice at any time via "Cookie settings" in the footer.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>The Dashboard uses essential cookies to keep you signed in and protect against misuse. It does not show advertising.</p>

  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>
    We share information only with service providers that help us run our services (such as hosting, email and map
    data delivery), when required by law, or with your consent.
  </p>

  <h2>Data Retention and Security</h2>
  <p>
    We keep account data while your account is active and as needed for legal and accounting purposes. We use encrypted
    connections, hashed passwords and access controls to protect your data.
  </p>

  <h2>Your Choices and Rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask us to access, correct or delete your personal information by contacting us. You can control cookies in
    your browser settings and through our cookie banner.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>Our services are not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy. The date above shows when it last changed.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.company}, {SITE.region}<br />
    Phone / WhatsApp: <a href={`tel:${SITE.phoneTel}`}>{SITE.phoneDisplay}</a><br />
    Email: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>
  </p>
</Legal>
